## Phase 3: Search and Filter Engine
- [x] Implement text search over resident names.
- [x] Define data-driven filter descriptors for personality traits.
- [x] Define data-driven filter descriptors for mental/soul attributes.
- [x] Treat selected trait and attribute filters as relevance criteria, not hard exclusions.
- [x] Score each resident by how many selected criteria they match.
- [x] Keep residents with partial matches in the results, sorted below stronger matches.
- [x] Include match counts in result rows, such as `2/3` selected criteria matched.
- [x] Sort by match score first, then by readable resident name for stable results.

